# T_SCRE: the Parts tab of item 1: Ins installs an item whose ID is
# asked for, Install part too, and an item installed elsewhere moves
# here; digits naming no item are searched as text, finding none; the
# item itself (a cycle) and an item on loan are refused with their
# messages; Take out takes a part out to a location from the pick list.
K ENTER ALT-C P
S TAB1
K INS
S ASKID
T 25
K ENTER
S INSTOK
K INS
T 99999
K ENTER
S NOITEM
K ESC ESC INS
T 1
K ENTER
S CYCLE
K INS
T 5
K ENTER
S ONLOAN
K INS
T 22
K ENTER
S MOVEDIN
K HOME ALT-C T
S PICK
K HOME DOWN DOWN ENTER
S REMOVED
K ESC ESC ESC
